### Upload
< {%
  request.variables.set("ts", $timestamp)
%}
POST http://localhost:8080
    /api
    /upload?tag={{ts}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="meta"
Content-Type: application/json

{"k": "v"}
--WebAppBoundary
